  "_comment": "Curated OpenAPI overrides layer: the document envelope (info, servers, securitySchemes, security, tags) plus the non-derivable operation edits -- hand-authored operations the doc extractor cannot match, and per-field corrections (e.g. sentence-cased summaries, edited descriptions) that win over the generated overrides. The bulk mined prose lives in the generated build output (override_extractor.py); compose layers generated + curated. Keep this file to only what the generator cannot or should not derive.",
